vision; keep historical v0.5.0 (28bf96d) behavior compatible. Reuse the landed shared owners instead of duplicating them: internal/sessrepo (repository, event chain, lease and checkpoint record attestation), internal/sessstate (state reducer), internal/sessquery (selector, plans, winning-lease admission, sealed checkpoint admission), internal/canonicaljson (closed shapes), internal/localstore (paths, projection), internal/provhost (provider identity, manifest, probe, spawn, quiesce), internal/catalog and internal/traceability (contract census; run go run ./internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck and the cataloggen -check command from task-board.config.json). Read the Curator-managed go-testing-tools skill first; all CI local, never hosted; run the affected packages while iterating and the full configured validation suite once before the handoff. Budget: the run has 4 hours and the runtime constructs the Change Request with a 26-command suite after your handoff — hand off no later than 3 hours in; if the scope is not finished by then, hand off a coherent partial with the ratio stated honestly rather than exceeding the budget. Attach TASK-260830-14yo67_results.md, TASK-260830-14yo67_conformance-matrix.md and TASK-260830-14yo67_producer-evidence.tar.gz (a real gzip archive), keep the checklist current, then task-board handoff TASK-260830-14yo67 --role developer and exit promptly. Canonical CLI /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board. Model: codex gpt-5.6-luna max (operator fallback while Muse Spark transport is failing). The independent reviewer will be codex gpt-6-astra low.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
