"TASK-260830-14yo67_reviewer-cr1.md\\\",\\\"uri\\\":\\\"file://TASK-260830-14yo67/TASK-260830-14yo67_reviewer-cr1.md\\\"}]}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 8312,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 2078,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
