st.go:987:\\t\\t\\tname: \\\"an unowned entry is self-minted for a section that does not exist\\\",\\ninternal/traceability/traceability_test.go:991:\\t\\t\\tcontains: `unowned section \\\"section:10.999\\\" is self-minted for an unknown section`,\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2715,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 679,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
